  "description": "Get ready for Christmas with this huge collection of laser cut files! 🎁\nThis exclusive bundle includes 20+ complete sets of Christmas-themed designs — from elegant ornaments and layered lanterns to advent calendars, stars, snowflakes, nativity scenes, and cozy winter decorations.\nEach set is carefully crafted and ready to cut, helping you create hundreds of unique decorations and gifts. Perfect for Glowforge, xTool, LightBurn, and other laser cutting machines.\nWhether you decorate your home, prepare gifts, or create products for your shop — this bundle gives you everything you need to fill your space with festive magic. ✨\nWHAT YOU’LL GET:\n🎅 20+ full sets of laser cut designs (ornaments, lanterns, boxes, calendars, and more)\n🎅 Each set includes layered structures and assembly-ready parts\n🎅 File formats: SVG, DXF, AI, CDR, EPS, PDF, DWG\n🎅 Easy to cut and assemble – no glue needed for most models\n🎅 Compatible with all major laser cutting software\n🎅 Designed for materials of 3–4 mm thickness\nThis is your ultimate Christmas bundle – full of creativity, variety, and inspiration for the holiday season.\n🎁 Perfect for:\nHoliday markets, handmade Christmas gifts, small business production, craft workshops, and cozy family DIY projects.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Get ready for Christmas with this huge collection of laser cut files! 🎁<br>\nThis exclusive bundle includes 20+ complete sets of Christmas-themed designs — from elegant ornaments and layered lanterns to advent calendars, stars, snowflakes, nativity scenes, and cozy winter decorations.</p>\n<p>Each set is carefully crafted and ready to cut, helping you create hundreds of unique decorations and gifts. Perfect for Glowforge, xTool, LightBurn, and other laser cutting machines.</p>\n<p>Whether you decorate your home, prepare gifts, or create products for your shop — this bundle gives you everything you need to fill your space with festive magic. ✨</p>\n<p>WHAT YOU’LL GET:<br>\n🎅 20+ full sets of laser cut designs (ornaments, lanterns, boxes, calendars, and more)<br>\n🎅 Each set includes layered structures and assembly-ready parts<br>\n🎅 File formats: SVG, DXF, AI, CDR, EPS, PDF, DWG<br>\n🎅 Easy to cut and assemble – no glue needed for most models<br>\n🎅 Compatible with all major laser cutting software<br>\n🎅 Designed for materials of 3–4 mm thickness</p>\n<p>This is your ultimate Christmas bundle – full of creativity, variety, and inspiration for the holiday season.</p>\n<p>🎁 Perfect for:<br>\nHoliday markets, handmade Christmas gifts, small business production, craft workshops, and cozy family DIY projects.</p>",
